@startuml
title Schlagzähler Pico – Companion Protocol & Inter-Core Event Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

box "Companion Web Application" #E8F5E9
    participant "Angular Web App\n(Web Serial)" as Web
end box

box "Pico W – Core 1 (Display & I/O)" #E3F2FD
    participant "CompanionProtocol\n(Core 1)" as Proto
    participant "CommandHandler\n(Core 1)" as CmdH
end box

box "Inter-Core Queues (OSAL)" #FFF3E0
    queue "queue_core1_to_core0" as Q10
    queue "queue_core0_to_core1" as Q01
end box

box "Pico W – Core 0 (Game & Sensing)" #F3E5F5
    participant "App\n(Core 0)" as App0
    participant "GameController\n(Core 0)" as GC
    participant "HitDetector\n(Core 0)" as HD
end box

note over Q10, Q01 #FFFDE7
    <b>Inter-Core Queue Note:</b>
    Core 0 and Core 1 run independent execution loops.
    Queue pops are decoupled and execute asynchronously during each core's polling tick.
end note

== 1. Device Boot & Handshake ==

App0 -> Q01: Core0ToCore1Message\n(MSG_BOOT_STATUS: success=true, msg="OK")
activate App0
deactivate App0
Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>BOOT success=1 msg=OK</b>
deactivate Proto

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_HANDSHAKE</b>\n(proto_ver=1.0, flags=BINARY_MODE, nonce=0x42)
activate Proto
note over Proto: Sets BINARY TX encoding\nAborts any active capture transfer
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_HANDSHAKE_ACK</b>\n(status=OK, proto=1.0, fw=0.3.0, nonce=0x42, uptime)
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_status()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_REQUEST_STATUS)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_REQUEST_STATUS)
deactivate App0
activate GC
GC -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (ARMED)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=READY, new=READY)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_MODE_CHANGED (active=COUNT, param=0)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=0)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

loop Drain Core 0 Status Updates
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SENSOR_STATUS</b>\n(status=ARMED)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_STATE</b>\n(old=READY, new=READY)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_MODE</b>\n(active=COUNT, param=0)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SCORE</b>\n(value=0)
    deactivate Proto
end

== 2. Sensor Calibration Workflow ==

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_CALIBRATE</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_calibration()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_REQUEST_CALIBRATION)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> HD: HitDetector_start_calibration()
activate HD
App0 -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (CALIBRATING)
deactivate App0
deactivate HD

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SENSOR_STATUS</b>\n(status=CALIBRATING)
deactivate Proto

note over HD, App0: Core 0 collects 10'000 ADC samples (1500 ms)\nComputes baseline, noise, and base_threshold

HD -> App0: Calibration complete
App0 -> Q01: MSG_CALIBRATION_RESULT (success=1, baseline=512, noise=14, threshold=568)
App0 -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (ARMED)

loop Drain Calibration Result & Arming
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_CALIBRATION_RESULT</b>\n(success=1, baseline=512, noise=14, threshold=568)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SENSOR_STATUS</b>\n(status=ARMED)
    deactivate Proto
end

== 3. Game Configuration Workflow ==

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_SET_MODE</b>\n(mode=TIMED)
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_set_mode(GAME_MODE_TIMED)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_SET_GAME_MODE: mode=TIMED)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_SET_GAME_MODE)
deactivate App0
activate GC
GC -> GC: Set active_mode = TIMED, param = 30s
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_MODE_CHANGED (active=TIMED, param=30)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_MODE</b>\n(active=TIMED, param=30)
deactivate Proto

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_SET_PARAMETER</b>\n(param=45)
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_set_parameter(45)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_SET_GAME_PARAMETER: param=45)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_SET_GAME_PARAMETER)
activate GC
GC -> GC: Set parameter = 45s
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_MODE_CHANGED (active=TIMED, param=45)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_MODE</b>\n(active=TIMED, param=45)
deactivate Proto

== 4. Game Execution & Real-Time Hit Telemetry ==

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_START</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_start()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_START_GAME)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_START_GAME)
activate GC
GC -> GC: GameController_start() (state: READY -> RUNNING)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=READY, new=RUNNING)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=0)
GC -> Q01: MSG_TIMER_CHANGED (elapsed=0, remaining=45000)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

loop Drain Start Notifications
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_STATE</b>\n(old=READY, new=RUNNING)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SCORE</b>\n(value=0)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_TIMER</b>\n(elapsed=0, remaining=45000)
    deactivate Proto
end

note over HD: Piezo ADC DMA buffer triggers HitDetector\nSample exceeds dynamic threshold!
HD -> GC: GameController_on_hit(hit_event)
activate GC
GC -> GC: score++ (score = 1)
GC -> Q01: MSG_HIT_DETECTED (id=1, peak=1840, intensity=1272)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=1)
deactivate GC

loop Drain Hit & Score Update
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_HIT_DETECTED</b>\n(id=1, peak=1840, intensity=1272)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SCORE</b>\n(value=1)
    deactivate Proto
end

note over GC: Periodic 100 ms Tick (GameController_tick)
GC -> Q01: MSG_TIMER_CHANGED (elapsed=1000, remaining=44000)
Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_TIMER</b>\n(elapsed=1000, remaining=44000)
deactivate Proto

== 5. Game Finish Condition & Reset ==

note over GC: Timer reaches 0 ms (TIME_LIMIT reached)
GC -> GC: GameController_finish(GAME_END_TIME_LIMIT)
activate GC
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_FINISHED (final_score=24, total_time_ms=45000, reason=TIME_LIMIT)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=RUNNING, new=FINISHED)
deactivate GC

loop Drain Finish Notifications
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_FINISHED</b>\n(score=24, time_ms=45000, reason=TIME_LIMIT)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_STATE</b>\n(old=RUNNING, new=FINISHED)
    deactivate Proto
end

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_RESET</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_reset()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_RESET_GAME)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_RESET_GAME)
activate GC
GC -> GC: Reset score & state: FINISHED -> READY
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=FINISHED, new=READY)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=0)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

loop Drain Reset Notifications
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_GAME_STATE</b>\n(old=FINISHED, new=READY)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SCORE</b>\n(value=0)
    deactivate Proto
end

== 6. High-Speed Raw Signal Capture & Streaming ==

Web -> Proto: <b>CMD_CAPTURE</b>\n(action=START, target=ALL)
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_capture_action(1)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_REQUEST_CAPTURE: enable=true)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 0 loop tick)</color></size>
activate App0
App0 -> HD: HitDetector_start_capture()
activate HD
App0 -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (CAPTURE_ARMED)
deactivate HD
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SENSOR_STATUS</b>\n(status=CAPTURE_ARMED)
deactivate Proto

note over HD: Physical hit occurs!\nPre-trigger buffer (1'000 samples) locked.\nPost-trigger buffer (20'000 samples) records for 2.0 s.
HD -> App0: Capture triggered
App0 -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (CAPTURING)
Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_SENSOR_STATUS</b>\n(status=CAPTURING)
deactivate Proto

note over HD: Capture completes (total 21'000 samples at 10 kHz)
HD -> App0: Capture complete
App0 -> Q01: MSG_CAPTURE_READY (rate=10000, pre=1000, count=21000, samples=ptr)
activate App0
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)\n<size:10><color:#666666>(asynchronous Core 1 loop tick)</color></size>
activate Proto
Proto -> Proto: Set capture_tx_active = true, offset = 0
Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_CAPTURE_START</b>\n(rate=10000, pre=1000, count=21000, target=ALL)

loop Non-Blocking Transmission across Core 1 Ticks (chunked)
    Proto -> Proto: CompanionProtocol_tick_capture_tx()
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_CAPTURE_DATA</b>\n(offset=0, count=128, samples=...)
    Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_CAPTURE_DATA</b>\n(offset=..., count=128, samples=...)
end

Proto --> Web: <b>MSG_CAPTURE_END</b>\n(count=21000)
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_capture_action(0)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: MSG_REQUEST_CAPTURE (enable=false)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

@enduml
